_meanings:
.²1 To stumble, tumble, fall down, slip, trip; {#sKalati caraRaM BUmO nyastaM#}
 {#na cArdratamA mahI#} <ls>Mk. 9. 13</ls>; <ls>Ku. 5. 24</ls>.
.²2 To totter, waver, shake, fluctuate.
.²3 To be disobeyed or violated (as an order); {#devasya SAsanaM pOrezu#}
 {#kaTaM sKalizyati#} <ls>Mu. 3</ls>, <ls n="Mu.">3. 24</ls>; <ls>R. 18. 43</ls>.
.²4 To fall or deviate from the right course; {#manmaTena pariluptamatInAM#}
 {#prAyaSaH sKalitamapyupakAri#} <ls>Ki. 9. 37</ls>.
.²5 To be affected or excited; {#mAtsaryarAgopahatAtmanAM hi sKalanti sADuzvapi#}
 {#mAnasAni#} <ls>Ki. 3. 53</ls>, <ls n="Ki.">13. 6</ls>.
.²6 To err, blunder, commit mistakes; {#sKalato hi karAlambaH suhftsacivacezwitam#}
 <ls>H. 3. 127</ls> (where it has sense 1 also).
.²7 To stammer, lisp, falter; {#vadanakamalakaM SiSoH smarAmi sKaladasamaYjasamaYjujalpitaM#}
 {#te#} <ls>U. 4. 4</ls>; <ls>R. 9. 76</ls>; <ls>Ku. 5. 56</ls>.
.²8 To fail, have no effect; {#rAGavaH sKalitavIryamAtmani#} <ls>R. 11. 83</ls>.
.²9 To drop, drip, trickle; {#vipaNkatIrasKalitormisaMhatiH#} <ls>Ki. 8. 27</ls>.
.²10 To go, move.
.²11 To disappear.
.²12 To collect, gather.
